00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,090
听：An Amateur Journalist.

2
00:00:02,090 --> 00:00:04,180
跟读：An Amateur Journalist.

3
00:00:04,180 --> 00:00:23,735
听：Jane is a housewife, but delighted to work as an amateur journalist. It is a dilemma for her to rush between family and work, and it is also unusual for the News Department to depend on an amateur to cover crimes. But Jane is really gifted.

4
00:00:23,735 --> 00:00:43,289
跟读：Jane is a housewife, but delighted to work as an amateur journalist. It is a dilemma for her to rush between family and work, and it is also unusual for the News Department to depend on an amateur to cover crimes. But Jane is really gifted.

5
00:00:43,289 --> 00:01:07,557
听：It is admirable that she is seldom accused of making mistakes. And, eager to become more professional, she concentrates on her job and updates herself now and then. Once she is informed of a new case, her normal working process is as follows: first, she makes appointments with guilty people for interviews.

