7
00:01:31,825 --> 00:01:50,569
听：So as to acquire accurate stories, she usually demands to record what they say. Meanwhile, a technically good colleague will assist her in taking photographs. Second, she assesses whether they are deliberately hiding the truth.

8
00:01:50,569 --> 00:02:09,313
跟读：So as to acquire accurate stories, she usually demands to record what they say. Meanwhile, a technically good colleague will assist her in taking photographs. Second, she assesses whether they are deliberately hiding the truth.

9
00:02:09,313 --> 00:02:32,205
听：If she is skeptical about their words, she will look into the case herself. Third, she writes thorough stories ahead of the deadline and submits them to the senior chief editor, who polishes and approves every section. Finally, her stories will be published in different editions of their magazine.

